        "title": "Add Russian localization",
        "body": "## Summary\n\n- Add Russian app localization (`ru.lproj`) with full `Localizable.strings` coverage\n- Add Russian to the app language picker and language catalog checks\n- Add Russian website localization, language selector entry, and `hreflang` metadata\n- Add test coverage for the Russian language catalog entry\n\n## Behavior proof\n\n- Playwright rendered the website from `docs/` at `index.html?lang=ru&theme=light` and verified the Russian selector plus representative translated copy.\n- Linked proof artifact: https://gist.github.com/Kirchberg/74c02e158b67bd948fb000bc3a326c0d\n\n```text\nRendered CodexBar website with ?lang=ru\n{\n  \"htmlLang\": \"ru\",\n  \"htmlDir\": \"ltr\",\n  \"localeDataset\": \"ru\",\n  \"selectValue\": \"ru\",\n  \"selectedLanguage\": \"Русский\",\n  \"russianOption\": \"Русский\",\n  \"title\": \"CodexBar — все лимиты AI-кодинга в вашей строке меню\",\n  \"navDocs\": \"Документация\",\n  \"navSource\": \"Исходный код\",\n  \"navDownload\": \"Скачать\",\n  \"hero\": \"Все лимиты AI-кодинга, в строке меню.\",\n  \"providersTitle\": \"56 провайдеров, одна строка меню\",\n  \"authCookies\": \"Cookie\"\n}\nPASS: Russian website selector and representative translated copy rendered correctly.\n```\n\n## Verification\n\n- `plutil -lint Sources/CodexBar/Resources/ru.lproj/Localizable.strings`\n- `node Scripts/check-app-locales.mjs --test`\n- `node Scripts/check-app-locales.mjs`\n- `node Scripts/check-site-locales.mjs`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Playwright website proof for `?lang=ru`\n\n## Notes\n\n`swift test --filter LocalizationLanguageCatalogTests` still cannot complete in my local environment because the build fails first inside the transitive `KeyboardShortcuts` dependency:\n\n```text\nerror: external macro implementation type 'PreviewsMacros.SwiftUIView' could not be found for macro 'Preview(_:body:)'; plugin for module 'PreviewsMacros' not found\n```\n\n`make check` passes locale/site/script/doc/package checks and SwiftFormat before the local SwiftLint step fails to load SourceKit:\n\n```text\nApp locales OK: Checked 21 catalogs against 1111 English keys.\napp/site locales OK: 22 locales, 50 site messages\n0/1235 files require formatting.\nSourceKittenFramework/library_wrapper.swift:58: Fatal error: Loading sourcekitdInProc.framework/Versions/A/sourcekitdInProc failed\nmake: *** [check] Error 133\n```\n\n",
